<title>LITHUANIA: AGRICULTURAL BANK'S 1996 INCOME STATEMENT.</title>
<headline>AGRICULTURAL BANK'S 1996 INCOME STATEMENT.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is the profit and loss</p>
<p>account statement of Lithuania's Agricultural Bank for 1996</p>
<p>compared with the previous year.</p>
<p>All figures in thousands of litas.</p>
<p>				     1996	     1995</p>
<p>    Interest income	    165,296	  189,563</p>
<p>    Interest expense	   57,817	   106,047</p>
<p>    NET INTEREST INCOME	107,479	  85,516</p>
<p>Fees and commision</p>
<p>    income, net		  17,250	   17,847</p>
<p>Foreign exchange</p>
<p>    profit, net		  8,231	    4,715</p>
<p>Net gain arising from</p>
<p>    investment activities    3,050	    1,339</p>
<p>    Other operating income   24,864	   4,685</p>
<p>    TOTAL INCOME		 160,874	  112,102</p>
<p>    Provision for loan losses 35,635	  1,018</p>
<p>NET INCOME AFTER PROVISION</p>
<p>    FOR LOAN LOSSES	    125,239	  111,084</p>
<p>Salaries and related</p>
<p>    social expenses	    46,429	   44,699</p>
<p>    Depreciation		 6,489	    3,941</p>
<p>Other adminsitrative</p>
<p>    expenses		     21,936	   31,501</p>
<p>Net loss from assets</p>
<p>    held for resale	    19,627	   124</p>
<p>    PROFIT BEFORE TAXES	30,758	   30,819</p>
<p>    Taxes			  5,235	    4,356</p>
<p>    PROFIT AFTER TAXES	 25,523	   26,463</p>
<p>--Ed Stoddard, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 18</p>
</text>
